 "remarks": "Impeccably maintained 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhouse in Stamford's desirable Mid-City neighborhood. The main level features an open concept living room and dining area, powder room, bright eat-in kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, and sliders to a private deck. Upstairs 2 large bedrooms, full bath and laundry conveniently located making it hassle free! Next, the primary bedroom will WOW you with its walk-in-closet and ensuite full bath. Last, but certainly not least the versatile finished lower level provides the perfect space for a home office, playroom or den with direct access to the attached garage. Additional highlights include hardwood floors throughout the main level, gas heat, central air and additional parking space plus ample visitor parking. Location is everything! Just across the street from Ridgeway Shopping Center and moments from Downtown Stamford's vibrant restaurants, shops, parks, entertainment, fitness centers, library, and Metro-North train station. Enjoy the perfect combination of comfort, convenience, and low-maintenance townhouse living in the heart of it all. This Mid-City gem truly has it all. Welcome Home!",
